---
<BaseLayout title="Work — Venkateshwar Jambula">
<header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Work</p><h1>A working archive.</h1><p class="lede">Not every useful thing became a company, paper or polished case study. This is the compact version of what I’ve built, contributed to, or learned by putting into production.</p></header>
{groups.map(group=><section class="work-group"><div class="work-group-header"><h2>{group.title}</h2><p>{group.note}</p></div>{group.items.map((item:any)=><article class="work-row"><span class="work-when">{item[0]}</span><div><h3>{item[1]}</h3><p>{item[2]}</p>{item[3]&&<div class="work-links">{item[3].map(([label,href]:string[])=><a href={href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{label} ↗</a>)}</div>}</div></article>)}</section>)}
</BaseLayout>